  "visual_review_status": "Batch v006 pins the same ten selected native landscape candidates to the final plan and its declared character sheets. S006’s raised supporting hand is pressed flat against the rock without separately delineated fingers. S007’s extended pointing arm exits the left edge and its hand is not visible. S008 v005 retains a pale vertical forehead mark, a partly cropped cowherd at the left edge, and a supporting hand showing a thumb plus three separately delineated fingers. These limitations remain disclosed; no art approval is implied.",
